SOFTWARE.

The mascot images (sys/ce/icon/popgb_mascot.bmp and
.github/images/popgb_mascot_C_kyoudai_4x.png) and the app icon
(sys/ce/icon/popgb.ico) are not covered by this MIT license: they are
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).

The font data (sys/ce/ce_shinonome16.h, sys/ce/ce_galmuri14.h,
sys/ce/ce_galmuri11.h) is not covered by this MIT license either; see
sys/ce/THIRDPARTY_LICENSES.txt.

